    "body": "A probe checked the other ladders with a Ramp entry and no angle. 2D Pocket does not have the bug: each chord has length. 2D Contour with side Inside has the same bug in `contour_bore.rs`, which this PR does not touch. This is #1664. A Bore descends on a steep chord at the cutting feed, up to 84 degrees in small holes. This is #1665. Both are P3.",
