    "body": "<!-- review-cost: 8d63209a72490a4fffe6b36f4e2cc6c3d6adde1a -->\n**Estimated agent cost:** ~$0.54 (98k tokens)\n| Run | Model | Tokens | Est. cost |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| independent review (merge-ready) | session model (inherited) | 98k | ~$0.54 |\nEffort: the work under review sits on #1609 (effort:high, safety floor). No escalation. The gate ran in a local worktree. The pr-test runner kept the started run in the queue for 23 minutes without a dequeue, so the review cancelled that queued run and built locally instead. Blended upper estimate at list price; cache reads make the real cost lower.\n",
