    "body": "Post-merge PathPilot Hub check on the 770MX simulator (PathPilot v2.14.4), 2026-11-14 22:27-22:28 local, file `hub-tests/1663-circular-ramp/pr.nc` (PR head 8d63209a), T4 4 mm end mill, length 2.0 in. Each level is entered by a helix (`G3/G2 ... Z` stepping down by 0.0049 in each arc), not a plunge. This confirms the fix. Between levels the program rapids to Z0.1969 and back to the floor it just cut. That is safe (one X/Y, inside the cut hole) but wastes time, so it is filed as a separate P7 follow-up.",
